  "description": "Provides core abstractions for certificate monitoring and metrics in .NET.\n      Includes common models, configuration options, and source interfaces for discovering\n      and analyzing certificates from multiple origins (file system, Windows certificate stores,\n      remote endpoints, or cloud providers). Enables consistent handling of certificate metadata,\n      expiration evaluation, and severity classification across monitoring scenarios.",
